  FOUND rank-2 with u,v tight + 1 more tight dirs: u=[6, -4, -24, 10, 12, 18, 2, 22, -20, -8, -14, -16], v=[15, 6, -3, -18, -9, -30, -21, 33, -27, -24, -36, 12]
searched 200k random 'both-axis-tight' rank-2 tori for a THIRD tight direction:
  counterexample (rank-2, >=3 full-support tight projections): True
