the pigeonhole logic: tight projection => dilated-AP ordering; two INDEP directions
with the same ordering sigma => u_{sigma(i)}, v_{sigma(i)} both = (linear in i) =>
(u_i,v_i) solves a 2x2 with RHS ~ i => (u,v) rank 1. Finitely many orderings +
infinitely many full-support dirs => two share an ordering => rank 1. QED-shape.
